 .\n\nWhy it matters for mTOR (★★): The lysosomal surface is the physic
 al platform for mTORC1 activation (Rag GTPases\, Ragulator) and the TFEB a
 xis\; endolysosomal biology is core mechanistic ground for the Atlas.\n\nC
 onference site: https://www.keystonesymposia.org/conferences/conference-li
 sting/meeting/lodging/e22025\n\nIn Oliver's mTOR Atlas: https://mtor-atlas
 .org/events/#ev-keystone-autophagosomes-and-endolysosomes-2025
