SUMMARY:ARDD 2025 – Aging Research and Drug Discovery (12th)
LOCATION:Ceremonial Hall\, University of Copenhagen\, Copenhagen\, Denmark
DESCRIPTION:The 12th Aging Research and Drug Discovery meeting – the larg
 est translational geroscience conference – convening academics\, biotech
  founders\, pharma and clinicians over a five-day hybrid event on the biol
 ogy of aging and drug development.\n\nWhy it matters for mTOR (★★): Ra
 pamycin/mTOR inhibition is one of the central pillars of aging pharmacolog
 y\; geroscience translation of mTOR is a recurring theme of ARDD and direc
 tly informs the Atlas gap/hypothesis layer.\n\nConference site: https://ag
 ingpharma.org/\n\nIn Oliver's mTOR Atlas: https://mtor-atlas.org/events/#e
 v-ardd-2025-aging-research-and-drug-discovery-12th
URL:https://agingpharma.org/
