 \, neurodegeneration\, infectious disease and development.\n\nWhy it matte
 rs for mTOR (★★): mTORC1 is the master negative regulator of autophagy
 \; this GRC directly covers the mechanistic and disease biology of the aut
 ophagy pathway central to the Atlas's autophagy/lysosome arm. Confirmed 20
 26 program includes a dedicated talk on "The TFEB-mTORC1 Axis in Tumorigen
 esis."\n\nConference site: https://www.grc.org/autophagy-in-stress-develop
 ment-and-disease-conference/2026/\n\nIn Oliver's mTOR Atlas: https://mtor-
