 e 2022 EMBO Workshop 'Brain Autophagy in Health and Disease.'\n\nWhy it ma
 tters for mTOR (★★): Autophagy is a core mTORC1-regulated process\; th
 is workshop covers mTOR-linked neuronal proteostasis and autophagy dysfunc
 tion in neurodegeneration and aging-related decline\, directly relevant to
  the Atlas's mTOR-autophagy axis.\n\nConference site: https://meetings.emb
 o.org/event/26-neuronal-autophagy\n\nIn Oliver's mTOR Atlas: https://mtor-
 atlas.org/events/#ev-embo-workshop-neuronal-autophagy-from-circuit-functio
