 TOR (★★): Flagship US geroscience meeting\; nutrient-sensing / mTOR bi
 ology and rapamycin-class interventions are recurring core topics.\n\nSpea
 kers or organisers with a profile in the Atlas: Andrzej Bartke\, Holly M. 
 Brown-Borg\, Alessandro Bitto\, Stacy A. Hussong\n\nConference site: https
 ://www.americanagingassociation.org/annual-meeting\n\nIn Oliver's mTOR Atl
