SUMMARY:NYAS: Cancer Metabolism and Signaling in the Tumor Microenvironment
  2027
LOCATION:New York\, NY\, USA
DESCRIPTION:One-day in-person meeting of the New York Academy of Sciences C
 ancer and Signaling Discussion Group\, on how tumour cells exploit signall
 ing and metabolic pathways in the tumour microenvironment to drive maligna
 nt growth. Recurring annual format\; the 2026 edition ran 24 Mar 2026 and 
 is closed.\n\nWhy it matters for mTOR (★): A cancer-metabolism meeting r
 ather than an mTOR meeting: PI3K-AKT-mTOR signalling is standard content i
 n this field but is not named in the announced scope\, and no programme is
  published yet for 2027. Listed as a low-cost\, single-day venue in the sa
 me subject area as several Atlas authors work in\, not as a source of mTOR
 -specific primary data.\n\nConference site: https://www.nyas.org/shaping-s
 cience/events/cancer-metabolism-and-signaling-in-the-tumor-microenvironmen
 t-2027\n\nIn Oliver's mTOR Atlas: https://mtor-atlas.org/events/#ev-nyas-c
 ancer-metabolism-and-signaling-in-the-tumor-microenvir-1gnewx8
URL:https://www.nyas.org/shaping-science/events/cancer-metabolism-and-signa
 ling-in-the-tumor-microenvironment-2027
