DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270408
SUMMARY:AACR Annual Meeting 2027
LOCATION:Orange County Convention Center\, Orlando\, FL\, USA
DESCRIPTION:The largest cancer research meeting in the world\, spanning bas
 ic\, translational and clinical oncology.\n\nWhy it matters for mTOR (★
 ★): The principal venue where human data on mTOR-pathway inhibitors surf
 ace first. Rapalog resistance mechanisms\, PI3K-AKT-mTOR biomarker work\, 
 and the clinical development of third-generation mTOR inhibitors are all r
 eported here. Added to correct a structural bias in this table: the mTOR e
 vidence base is heavily basic-science and geroscience\, while the human ev
 idence that the Atlas's translation-gap thesis depends on is adjudicated i
 n oncology.\n\nConference site: https://www.aacr.org/meeting/aacr-annual-m
 eeting-2027/\n\nIn Oliver's mTOR Atlas: https://mtor-atlas.org/events/#ev-
 aacr-annual-meeting-2027
URL:https://www.aacr.org/meeting/aacr-annual-meeting-2027/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
