SUMMARY:Keystone Symposia: Healthy Aging & Therapeutic Opportunities 2027
LOCATION:NTUH International Convention Center\, Taipei\, Taiwan
DESCRIPTION:Keystone Symposia conference examining emerging strategies for 
 promoting healthy aging\, with a focus on biomarkers of aging\, therapeuti
 c development\, and interventions to improve quality of life. Sessions cov
 er geromedicine\, biomarkers of aging\, non-pharmacologic approaches\, com
 bination therapies\, drug target identification\, and translational/regula
 tory challenges.\n\nWhy it matters for mTOR (★★): Co-organized by Bria
 n K. Kennedy\, a leading rapamycin/mTOR and NAD+ longevity researcher\; ge
 romedicine and combination-therapy sessions are directly adjacent to the A
 tlas's mTOR-intervention focus.\n\nSpeakers or organisers with a profile i
 n the Atlas: Brian K. Kennedy\, Joan B. Mannick\n\nConference site: https:
 //www.keystonesymposia.org/conferences/conference-listing/meeting/d32027\n
 \nIn Oliver's mTOR Atlas: https://mtor-atlas.org/events/#ev-keystone-sympo
 sia-healthy-aging-therapeutic-opportunities-20-i1a8d9
URL:https://www.keystonesymposia.org/conferences/conference-listing/meeting
 /d32027
