UID:american-transplant-congress-atc-2027@mtor-atlas.org
DTSTAMP:20261018T180043Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270605
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270610
SUMMARY:American Transplant Congress (ATC) 2027
LOCATION:Washington State Convention Center\, Seattle\, WA\, USA
DESCRIPTION:Joint annual meeting of the American Society of Transplantation
  (AST) and the American Society of Transplant Surgeons (ASTS)\; >4\,000 at
 tendees. (ATC 2026\, Boston\, 20-24 June 2026\, has already passed.)\n\nWh
 y it matters for mTOR (★★): Transplantation is the largest human expos
 ure dataset in existence for sirolimus and everolimus (approved for reject
 ion prophylaxis long before any geroscience trial) and the origin of the c
 anonical adverse-effect profile the Atlas records: hyperlipidaemia\, insul
 in resistance and new-onset diabetes\, impaired wound healing\, mucositis\
 , infection. Supplies the human safety denominator that geroscience trials
  cite second-hand. Atlas authors in this space: Budde K\, Saemann MD\, Sin
 ger LG.\n\nConference site: https://atcmeeting.org/\n\nIn Oliver's mTOR At
 las: https://mtor-atlas.org/events/#ev-american-transplant-congress-atc-20
 27
URL:https://atcmeeting.org/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
